# Allow-list of what may be uploaded to Vercel. It applies to BOTH projects built
# from this repo (the API at the root and the web app in web/), whatever their
# Root Directory, so it must let each one's files through. Secrets, the docs
# checkout and documents.jsonl stay on this machine.
/*

# API project
!/app.py
!/pyproject.toml
!/README.md
!/src
!/data
/data/*
!/data/keyword_chunks.jsonl.gz

# Web project (Root Directory: web)
!/web
/web/node_modules
/web/.next
/web/.env*
!/web/.env.example

**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
